<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.circle.reads ~ the follow-view: nyms under the recogniser's own names

`lares circle list [to=<circle>]` reads the private follow-view: each nym under the recogniser's own petname and its last-seen glamour. With no `--to` it lists every circle.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ all · one

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`all` params=`~ every circle`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one` params=`to/following ~ the following circle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ to · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/circle ~ one circle; absent, every circle`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose handle-book and circles act; absent, the one face standing open`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ edits this face's private graph alone; nothing crosses the wire`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.circle.reads]] ~ the list takes no further word`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the follow store refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ listed

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`listed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[circles]] ~ each circle and its nyms`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

